    description: "On the recorded aardvark-dns two-arm fixture the rust-analyzer arm's records for every struct (10), enum (3) and trait (1) carry no `stable_id`, while its function/method/field/variable records do: `hypergumbo backend-agreement` (docs/audits/0019, row `stable_id`) counts 134 disagree and 14 one-sided to `rust`, and the 14 are exactly the struct/enum/trait pairs. Either `hypergumbo_lang_rust_analyzer.translate` skips the stable_id for type-shaped SymbolInformation kinds, or the stable_id derivation it calls has no rule for them. Find which, fix at the producer (ADR-0057 §7: fix the producer, not the merge), pin the count in `AARDVARK_DNS_ATTRIBUTE_AGREEMENT`, and regenerate 0019 with scripts/regenerate-backend-agreement-table."  # 9ced
